WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.610
Huh? A vacation?

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.620
Oh, I have one more thing to mention!

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:11.750
There's someone who wants 
to come along on your trip.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.510
Well, he won't be that much trouble.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:17.170
Just keep an eye on him if you would.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:18.780
Stop them!

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:22.250
We can't embarrass the Shogun, the Bakufu!

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.970
We're stranded...

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:29.390
Forget about protecting the Shogun,

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:31.150
we're the ones who've been stranded.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:10.310
<b>The great Shogun, Shigeshige Tokugawa, 
has been lost on the ski slopes!!</b>

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:15.030
<b>Hijikata and the other stranded victims have two 
missions, to endure the cold and to find the Shogun.</b>

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:20.990
<b>A Vacation in Disorientation</b>

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:35.630
I think it's starting to snow harder.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.950
Gonna be a blizzard tonight.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:41.260
Will Kondo-san and the Shogun be okay?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.260
We need to worry about ourselves first.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:47.430
Isn't there a hut or something around here?

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:51.080
We wouldn't be stranded if there was.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:54.270
You can only be stranded when 
there aren't people around.

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.650
Hmm? What are they doing?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.440
Hey, whatcha doing?

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:06.910
Are you looking for food, doggie?

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:09.110
I'm not like you.

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:10.910
I don't eat food off the ground.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:13.830
Never? Never ever?

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:17.950
Oops, some sukonbu fell out of my pocket.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.590
Uh oh, what should I do?

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.550
<b>Sukonbu</b>

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:25.260
Why are you two diving for the food?!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.890
Stop it! That's embarrassing!

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:30.210
Once it touches the ground, 
it's returned to the earth!

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.870
The food is mine!

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.900
No, it's mine!

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.330
Hey, what are you idiots doing?

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.790
If you're going to get in the way, you 
should also return to the earth.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.900
Stop playing with valuable food.

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:46.080
Oops, I dropped some mayonnaise.

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.790
What should I do?

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.880
That takes care of the interference.

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:04.290
Okita-san, is that a snow hut?

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:08.420
We're not going to find any buildings 
out here in the middle of nowhere.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:11.310
And there's no guarantee that 
there are any caves nearby.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.980
But there's plenty of snow.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:17.060
In that case, we can find 
shelter in the snow.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.620
Oh, my. Did you hear that, Kagura-san?

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:23.380
He's going to use snow 
as shelter from the snow.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:28.740
I guess the baboon is turning feral on us.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.250
How can snow possibly keep you warm?

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.870
Freiza's cold-hearted attacks 
won't help either.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.740
Have you forgotten how agonizing 
it was for Vegeta to serve Frieza,

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:40.250
the one who destroyed his planet?!

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:42.330
Go inside and see for yourself.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.960
No thank you.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.260
We don't want to freeze to death.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.640
Oh, sorry if you get wet,

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.140
since it looks like some kind of restroom.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.270
Just go inside!

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.650
How is it, Gin-san, Kagura-chan?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:04:59.910
Huh?

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.150
Gin-san? Kagura-chan?

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.700
What is this?

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.280
Oh, wow.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.290
It's so warm.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:17.120
And not just in a physical sense.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.250
My entire soul feels warm.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.420
It's so comfortable.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.090
What is this?

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:31.010
Why do I feel this way?

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:32.220
This is...

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.060
This is almost like...

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.770
...I'm back inside my mother's womb.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.270
Well, I won't be letting you inside

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.320
since you apparently have 
a better place to sleep.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:46.740
F-Fine with me.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.550
It's not like I want to sleep in 
such a cramped and dark place.

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.830
Can't even roll over in here.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:55.190
Then get the hell out!
Don't make yourself comfortable!

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:56.940
You're the one who told us to come in!

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:59.150
You should thank us for trying 
this dump out for you.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:02.150
Ah! Did you just fart?!

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.890
Oopsie-daisy!

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:06.720
Okay, we'll go find our own place to sleep.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.850
That's not the exit!

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:09.610
Huh?

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:13.720
The entrance was so small that I figured 
I should find a different way out.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.350
That's bullshit!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.190
You did it on purpose!

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.520
You were mad so you destroyed it!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:21.320
Hey, what now?

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:23.230
The snow's getting worse!

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:26.670
We're wasting our energy here!

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.980
Are you trying to get 
us all frozen to death?!

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:31.200
Hey! Over here, everyone!

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:34.250
You shouldn't be fighting 
at a time like this.

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.450
I'll let you all inside my snow hut!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.250
Come on!

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.330
Katsura, who gave you 
permission to walk around?

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.750
I'm getting used to this body.

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:46.510
I did some looking around, 
and I came across this den.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.040
What is this den?

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.090
Are there bears hibernating inside?

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:54.600
Don't worry. I already chased off the beasts.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:57.850
Huh? There were actually bears inside?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.350
There wouldn't be bears here.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.270
It was just...

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.400
Bigfoot.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:13.740
Bigfoot doesn't exist!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:17.040
Why would a mythical UMA be living out here?!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:19.750
<b>Shocking!! The giant ape Bigfoot is real?!</b>

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.750
Why would Bigfoot wear sneakers?!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.250
Well, I can't be positive

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.670
since I was preoccupied at the time.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:28.820
It could have been a man 
with really big feet.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:30.340
No, I'll confirm it for you!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:31.720
Nobody has feet this big!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:36.680
<b>Sorry. It's cold, so can I stay here tonight? No? You 
might have a big body, but your brain is tiny, Stupidfoot!</b>

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:37.600
I asked him to let me stay the night, 
but he wouldn't listen to me.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:41.390
So I attached a letter to 
his shoe with thumbtacks,

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.730
and he seemed to get the message.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.440
The wrong message!

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.730
His foot's all bloody from the thumbtacks!

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:50.870
He even left this wonderful bed.

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.680
That's just a stinking sneaker!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.940
If I sleep in here, I won't freeze to death.

00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:00.130
Ow! Something's stabbing into my back!

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:02.250
Who put a thumbtack here?!

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:05.780
Hey! I can hear footsteps coming closer!

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:08.250
Crap! Bigfoot-san is coming back!

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.800
Run for it!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.010
Hey, where are you going?

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.770
Get this thumbtack out of my back.

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.740
Oh, you're back?

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.490
Uh, I think it's around here.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:23.620
Yes, that's it.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.300
Hey, this is looking bad.

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:37.970
If we don't find some sort of 
shelter from this blizzard,

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:39.030
we're all gonna freeze to death!

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:42.250
Everyone! Over here!

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:44.620
I found a great place!

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.040
Sis!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.170
There's actually a cave here.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.180
It's not any warmer,

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:59.110
but at least we won't be buried by the snow.

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:02.570
Yes, and there's even food here.

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:04.060
Really?

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.710
Take a look.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:08.060
I managed to find so much food.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:13.400
Sis, what are those?

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.220
Chupacabras.

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:26.720
This appears to be a chupacabra nest.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:30.800
Beyond the chupacabras, you 
won't find bears or Bigfoot.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.780
Instead, you'll find the 
ancient city of Fazan,

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:37.680
said to have been conquered by 
the chupacabras in one night!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:42.790
If we defeat the chupacabras and 
reach the core system of Fazan,

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:46.080
we won't have to worry about 
being stranded anymore!

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.690
All of our problems will be solved!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.210
Now, let's rise up!

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:54.490
We must fight for our victory!

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:56.860
I know that we can do this if we're together!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.490
Let's go!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:00.570
Huh?

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:08.990
The blizzard keeps getting worse.

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:10.540
What are we going to do?!

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:14.210
The sun's gone down and we 
still haven't found shelter!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.970
We'll be popsicles in no time!

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:22.290
Stop whining about a little cold, you babies!

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.820
After Bigfoot-san stuck 
a bunch of needles in me,

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.230
I feel like my body's on fire!

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:30.230
You should all come back 
to see Bigfoot-san with me!

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:31.730
Hell no!

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.730
We should use the cave I found.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:39.320
Look at this delicious fried chupacabra.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.870
She can turn unidentified creatures 
into an unidentified substance!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.700
Everything she touches becomes dark matter!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.830
How are we supposed to 
spend the night in the lair

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:48.440
of those scary creatures?!

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.120
And even if we wanted to turn back,

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.750
we wouldn't be able to see where 
we're going in this blizzard!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:59.910
It's snowing so hard that we can't even see 
the smoke from the fire we left behind.

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:03.330
I'm pretty sure the snow 
already put out the fire.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:06.200
Kondo-san and the Shogun 
won't know where to go.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.270
Don't worry.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.880
I'm sure that they'll return.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:10.700
To the earth.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:12.320
Don't say that!

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.020
If anything happens to the Shogun,

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.360
everyone here will be returning to the earth!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.590
It'll be fine, Hijikata-san.

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:20.860
I'm sure that we'll all return.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.560
The Shogun's white underwear...

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:26.080
Our white faces...

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:29.730
Everything will become white under this snow.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.710
Everything will return to zero!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.210
The sadists can't take it!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.940
They've already given up!

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.400
Get a grip!

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:38.770
If we don't give up, we'll 
find a way to survive!

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:40.130
Isn't that right, Hijikata-san?

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:43.660
Tsk.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:50.080
All I can say is that it doesn't 
get any worse than this.

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:53.270
But on the bright side, 
it can't get any worse.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.090
We just have to climb our 
way out of this hole.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:57.520
That's one less problem to worry about.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:11:59.790
Hijikata-san...

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:00.960
What?

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:03.490
It just got worse!

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:09.180
Why did a bear have to show up now?!

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:11.130
C-Calm down, Gintoki!

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.580
We don't have any chance 
of outrunning a bear!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.820
The correct course of action 
is to play dead!

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:17.920
You're gonna be dead for real!

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.060
Idiot!

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:21.000
That's just an urban legend!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.430
Stare the bear right in its 
eyes and slowly back away!

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:25.230
If you turn your back, it'll...

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:26.820
Oh?

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:29.930
That's no good, Hijikata-san.
You need to watch your rear.

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:33.940
I thought you were a bear and stabbed you.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:38.650
Shit, there was someone else I 
didn't want to turn my back on...

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:41.350
Hey.

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:44.820
You should probably play dead.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:47.320
D-Damn you...

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.490
What are you people doing?!

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:51.410
This isn't the time to fight among ourselves!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:52.500
Shin-chan! Look out!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.740
The bear's coming for you!

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.960
Shin-chan!

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.980
Shin-chan!

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:22.530
Are you all right?

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:24.400
Huh?

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:27.080
It appears that everyone survived.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.410
Th-Th-That voice...

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:30.900
C-Could it be?!

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:34.990
It is I. The great Shogun,

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:38.770
Shigeshige Tokugawa.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.740
Shin-chan!

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.020
Are you okay, Shin-chan?

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.400
Shin-chan!

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:52.980
Man, the Shogun is really something.

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:56.940
He was able to find this cabin 
on his own and take shelter.

00:13:57.130 --> 00:14:01.150
I was floundering around in 
the snow when he saved me.

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:04.600
Can't tell who's protecting who.

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:06.450
I have failed as a warrior.

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:09.550
I am prepared to slice open my belly.

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:11.950
But now that the Shogun has saved my life,

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:16.460
I must devote myself to ensuring 
that the Shogun returns safely.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.540
What?! The Shogun!

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:25.990
What happened?!

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.830
What happened to the Shogun?!

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.300
And why are you all so beat up?!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:33.810
U-Uh, Kondo-san. You see...

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:37.080
We were attacked by Bigfoot and chupacabras.

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:37.770
Huh?

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:40.140
We tried to fight back, but...

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.820
Damn those UMA! I'll make them pay!

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:44.840
UMA?! That's impossible!

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:45.910
It's true!

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:47.810
It was all the UMA's fault!

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:48.980
Right, Sho-chan?

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:50.320
Yup, leader.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.530
Damn those UMA!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.330
Shogun, hang in there!

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:56.800
Shogun!

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.330
Where am I?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.330
Why am I here?

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.830
H-Hey!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.840
His memory's been damaged!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.220
K-Kondo, what's happened?

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.340
Why am I here?

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:11.700
Lord Shogun, have you forgotten?

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:15.350
These idiots brought you to 
the mountains to hunt UMA.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:18.230
But while we were following 
Bigfoot's footsteps,

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:20.140
we ran into a blizzard and got split up.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:24.360
We all got stranded for playing along 
with this farce of yours.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.340
I can't believe this.

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:30.410
I've put the lives of my people in 
danger to satisfy an irrational whim.

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:32.390
No, that's not what happened!

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:35.370
I am not qualified to rule.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:41.230
Heavens! If this storm is 
meant as my punishment,

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:44.560
I offer my meager life as appeasement!

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:45.880
Sure, Shogun.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:48.760
This wasn't your fault, Lord Shogun!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:51.630
Amateurs can't predict the weather!

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:55.960
In any case, we should be glad 
that we're all together now.

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:57.390
Help is bound to come.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:00.640
But you will have to put up 
with this dirty shack for now.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:02.140
Hey, how's that?

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:04.710
I've managed to cover up all your crimes.

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:07.060
Make sure you get me a reward out of this.

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:09.800
Most of those crimes were yours, not ours!

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.900
And none of them have been resolved yet!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.940
Listen up, guys.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:22.430
We can't do anything until 
this blizzard stops.

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:24.180
We'll probably do more harm than good

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:26.560
by going outside, so sit 
tight and wait for help.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.780
But this shack is nothing more 
than four shabby walls.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:31.380
It's just as cold inside as it is outside.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.180
If you fall asleep, you'll die.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:34.680
We need to huddle together for warmth.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.600
Yell when you see someone nodding off.

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:40.100
How are we supposed to huddle together?

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:44.100
We'll stand with our backs facing 
each other, to pool our body heat.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:46.280
The center will be the warmest.

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:48.270
The Shogun will go there.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.980
Then we have the girls and kids.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.110
The men will be on the outside.

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:56.120
Okay, first we'll have the 
girls stand next to the Shogun.

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:00.300
Hey, the Shogun's getting excited.

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:02.080
He's got something dirty in mind.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.230
Hey, what are they doing?

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.460
Why are they whispering in the corner?

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.080
Hurry up!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.830
Doesn't it smell?

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:11.520
Like a wash rag drenched in spoiled milk.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:13.870
Kagura-chan, you shouldn't say that.

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:16.050
I'm hearing some really nasty comments!

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:19.680
But you're starting to tear up, boss lady.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.470
Stop that, Kagura-chan.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.100
Some things aren't meant 
to be said out loud...

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:26.540
Yeah, and you're saying them out loud!

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.110
The Shogun can hear everything you're saying!

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:32.630
Um, I believe that the smell is 
coming from the fur he's wearing.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.950
I believe that he found it in this cabin.

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:37.660
Could you ask him to take it off?

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.240
I can't do that!

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.540
We're trying to stay warm!

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.790
Except he already took it off!

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.940
The Shogun has changed his objective!

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:47.540
He's seeking a different kind of warmth!

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:50.110
Hey, the Shogun took off that fur.

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.120
Get going.

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:52.550
Hey, hold on.

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:54.680
Doesn't it stink?

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:56.240
Why are you joining in?!

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:57.550
He already took off the fur!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.410
Are you sure that the smell 
was coming from the fur?

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:02.560
I think the smell's gotten worse.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:05.480
I think this is a completely different smell.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.650
Just stop already!

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:07.880
The Shogun's wearing 
nothing but his underwear!

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:08.690
What could possibly stink?!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:11.760
The Shogun is pretending to stretch 
while checking if his armpits smell!

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:14.070
Stop! Don't hurt him anymore!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:16.070
That must be the source.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:19.480
Must have been all stuffed up under that fur.

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:21.150
We'll have to ask him to take it off.

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:22.200
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:24.580
It would be suicide to stand naked 
in the middle of a blizzard!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.830
Shogun!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.580
You don't even have an heir yet?!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:30.830
That's gross. I don't wanna go near him.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.960
Want me to kill you?!

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:35.520
He took everything off because 
you kept complaining!

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:36.730
Now huddle together!

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:38.970
The Shogun needs some warmth 
for his body and heart!

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:41.240
Stop your whining.

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:45.060
We don't have time to gripe about 
bad smells or grotesque objects.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.340
That's rude.

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:48.030
Don't you have any tact?

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:48.850
Fine.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:49.980
We'll go first.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:51.500
Oh, that works.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:52.980
I don't care who's first, just go!

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:56.240
I can't smell anything.

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:57.740
It's just a man's odor...

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:01.240
Lord Shogun! Have them executed!

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:04.690
S-Sorry, China girl...

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:06.170
It's fine if you understand now.

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:07.260
It's not fine!

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:09.250
Why are the two of you 
agreeing now of all times?!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.000
Don't worry.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.170
We can't huddle together if he's naked,

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.460
so let's find him some new clothes.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.670
And they'll help to cover the smell.

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:19.220
Hey!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.260
You've reduced the Shogun to a dress-up doll!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:24.530
How's this?

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.040
What are you trying to cover?!

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:28.040
Why is he wearing nothing but a turtleneck?!

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:30.910
The place that really needs to 
be covered is still exposed!

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:34.270
And why does this remind me of 
a plastic surgery commercial?!

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:37.170
That particular region has its 
own turtleneck already.

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:39.050
Why are you grinning like an idiot?

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:40.280
That wasn't funny!

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:41.870
That settles it.

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:44.930
The adults will have to get things going.

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:48.650
Change the plan so we 
stand next to the Shogun,

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:50.160
while the girls and kids are outside.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.290
Here's a diagram.

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.170
Why is the censor pointing towards me?!

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.820
Somebody has to do it.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:01.130
Don't you specialize in doing the 
dirty work, Shinsengumi Vice Chief?

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.680
This is too dirty!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:06.510
Stop bitching and start 
warming the Shogun's Shogun!

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:09.970
This is all your fault!

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.550
You should take responsibility!

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:13.560
Zura!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.620
This is your chance to defeat the Bakufu!

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:18.120
He's already limp!

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:19.030
Shinsengumi!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:22.220
You should be ashamed of yourselves 
for exposing your leader!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:23.830
Toshi!

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:24.830
Curly hair!

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:26.370
-Zura!

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:26.370
-Shinsengumi!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.990
Toshi!

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.500
Curly hair!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.680
Hey! Wait!

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:37.420
Look out!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.050
Hmm? What's that?!

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.670
Hey! Look at that!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.890
Something's... Something's rising in the sky!

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:55.270
Is that an SOS signal from 
Kondo-san and the others?!

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:57.420
Hold on!

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:58.270
That's...

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:01.440
The Shogun?

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:22.800
We're warm now.

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:34.480
Hey, look at him!

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:36.770
Damn, he's so cool!

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.010
He's airborne!

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:40.300
Awesome!

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:42.460
What? Is he a pro or something?

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:43.860
Huh?

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.530
Yes, hello?

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:49.230
Good work.

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:51.830
I guess I put you through a lot of trouble.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:56.290
Yeah, he's completely hooked, 
so we're back again today.

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:59.290
But I have one question.

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:08.400
Is that how snowboarding works?

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
<b>Next Episode: There are some things you 
should not forget when drinking away 
the past year at year-end parties.</b>

00:23:40.700 --> 00:23:41.640
Next time:

00:23:41.650 --> 00:23:43.230
There are some things you should not forget

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:45.020
when drinking away the past 
year at year-end parties.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.360
<b>We're already halfway through December. For 
grown-ups, this is the season for forgetting.</b>

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:55.030
<b>Drink alcohol, but don't let alcohol get the better 
of you. Gin-san gets drunk and makes a huge mistake?!</b>
